Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,名字。来干什么。\N{\fs29}Name. Business.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.20,0:00:03.80,Main,,0,0,0,,亚伦，长官。暴风城来的。\N{\fs29}Aaron, sir. From Stormwind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.20,0:00:07.60,Main,,0,0,0,,我想当圣骑士。\N{\fs29}I want to be a paladin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:11.40,Main,,0,0,0,,……我想学着当圣骑士。\N{\fs29}...I want to learn to be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.90,0:00:23.70,Main,,0,0,0,,躲我后面！\N{\fs29}Behind me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.40,Main,,0,0,0,,我爷爷的盾。从没裂过，一次都没有。\N{\fs29}Grandad's shield. Never cracked. Not once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.10,Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢。我叫亚伦。\N{\fs29}Thank you. I'm Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.00,Main,,0,0,0,,杜克！打不烂的杜——哎哟！\N{\fs29}Duke! Duke the Unbre— ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:46.00,Main,,0,0,0,,我第一！\N{\fs29}First!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.50,0:00:49.10,Main,,0,0,0,,你是今天第七个。\N{\fs29}You're the seventh today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.00,0:00:55.80,Main,,0,0,0,,卫兵一半都派到远方打仗去了。\N麻烦一周比一周近。\N{\fs29}Half the Guard's off fighting in distant lands.\NTrouble's closer every week.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.00,0:01:00.20,Main,,0,0,0,,所以就让我临时顶个副队长。\N治安官玛克布莱德在里面。\N{\fs29}So here I am. Deputized. Marshal McBride's inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:04.24,Main,,0,0,0,,嘿，市民！你看着挺结实。\N{\fs29}Hey, citizen! You look like a stout one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.40,Main,,0,0,0,,嘿，市民！你看着挺结实。\N{\fs29}Hey, citizen! You look like a stout one.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.44,0:01:08.24,Main,,0,0,0,,圣骑士。\N{\fs29}Paladin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:09.54,Main,,0,0,0,,正在学。\N{\fs29}Trying to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.54,0:01:10.34,Main,,0,0,0,,……战士。\N{\fs29}...Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,狗头人占了北边的矿——耗子脸，\N脑袋上顶着蜡烛。去清掉十个。\N{\fs29}Kobolds took the north mine — rat faces,\Ncandles on their heads. Clear out ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.64,0:01:16.64,Main,,0,0,0,,十个？简单！\N{\fs29}Ten? Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.74,0:01:18.20,Main,,0,0,0,,有工钱。\N{\fs29}There's pay in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.24,0:01:21.44,Main,,0,0,0,,总有一天把它们赶走。……不是今天。\N{\fs29}One day we'll drive them out. ...Not today.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.04,0:01:27.64,Main,,0,0,0,,往北去？给我带点狼肉回来，\N行吗？……我叫伊根。\N{\fs29}Heading north? Bring me back some wolf meat,\Nwould you? ...Eagan, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.64,0:01:29.24,Main,,0,0,0,,先打狗头人，再打狼！\N{\fs29}Kobolds first. Then wolves!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.64,0:01:33.04,Main,,0,0,0,,我恨死那些讨厌的森林狼了。\N{\fs29}I hate those nasty timber wolves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:36.44,Main,,0,0,0,,哦——它都没觉得痒。\N{\fs29}Ooh. That barely tickled it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.44,0:01:39.24,Main,,0,0,0,,……不过狼排是真香。\N{\fs29}...But I sure like eating wolf steaks.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.24,0:01:43.20,Main,,0,0,0,,肉换皮子，公道。剩下的修道院会收。\N{\fs29}Meat for leather — fair's fair.\NAbbey'll buy the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.24,0:01:46.60,Main,,0,0,0,,狗头人就在这条路上头。看见蜡烛就是了。\N{\fs29}Kobolds are up the path. Can't miss the candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.64,0:01:48.00,Main,,0,0,0,,我爸的靴子还好着呢。\N{\fs29}Dad's boots are fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.04,0:01:49.24,Main,,0,0,0,,谢谢你，伊根。\N{\fs29}Thank you, Eagan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:57.28,Main,,0,0,0,,咿——我跑！\N{\fs29}Yiieeeee! Me run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.08,0:02:08.08,Main,,0,0,0,,够十个了！\N{\fs29}That's ten!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.88,0:02:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,九个。……是一人十个，还是一共十个？\N{\fs29}Nine. ...Ten each, or ten total?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.28,0:02:15.28,Main,,0,0,0,,……一人十个。那还用说。\N{\fs29}...Each. Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:26.28,Main,,0,0,0,,修士，下一站是矿洞。教我点快的。\N{\fs29}Brother, the mine's next. Teach me something fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.18,0:02:30.38,Main,,0,0,0,,圣光，赐我力量。\N{\fs29}Pheta vi acahachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.38,0:02:35.44,Main,,0,0,0,,……那是什么？\N{\fs29}...What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.48,0:02:38.68,Main,,0,0,0,,「圣光，赐我力量。」……它本来就在你身上。\N{\fs29}'Light, give me strength.' ...It's already in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.08,0:02:40.28,Main,,0,0,0,,圣光，赐我力量。\N{\fs29}Pheta vi acahachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:46.88,Main,,0,0,0,,还来？！还来？！\N{\fs29}Again?! AGAIN?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.58,0:02:51.18,Main,,0,0,0,,不是为你自己。你站在这儿，是为了谁？\N{\fs29}Not for yourself. Who are you standing here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.68,0:02:58.08,Main,,0,0,0,,我爸。货箱压了他的腿。\N我跑去喊牧师——回来晚了。\N{\fs29}My dad. A crate crushed his leg.\NI ran for a priest — got back too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.68,0:03:01.38,Main,,0,0,0,,……就是这个。\N{\fs29}...There.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.68,0:03:04.28,Main,,0,0,0,,脚下一乱，它就没了。\N{\fs29}Stumble, and it's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:07.08,Main,,0,0,0,,……再来。给它找个去处。\N{\fs29}...Again. Give it somewhere to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:08.78,Main,,0,0,0,,圣光，赐我力量。\N{\fs29}Pheta vi acahachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.08,0:03:12.28,Main,,0,0,0,,……咦。不流了。\N{\fs29}...Huh. It stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.48,0:03:14.08,Main,,0,0,0,,……而且它不快。\N{\fs29}...And it isn't fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.48,0:03:20.28,Main,,0,0,0,,打了九个。剩下的都住在里面。\N{\fs29}Nine down. The rest live in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:28.68,Main,,0,0,0,,跑了吧！回回都跑！\N{\fs29}See? They always run!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:35.48,Main,,0,0,0,,一、二、三、四、五、六、\N七……八……九……十……十一。\N{\fs29}One, two, three, four, five, six, seven...\Neight... nine... ten... ...eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.38,0:03:38.38,Main,,0,0,0,,别数了。进去。\N{\fs29}Stop counting. In we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.88,0:03:43.48,Main,,0,0,0,,没事。……没事。\N{\fs29}It's fine. ...It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:46.48,Main,,0,0,0,,一面盾。……我不用盾。\N{\fs29}A shield. ...I don't use shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.08,0:03:50.28,Main,,0,0,0,,我有盾。\N{\fs29}Got a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:52.48,Main,,0,0,0,,现在你有两面了。\N{\fs29}Now you've got two.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.08,0:03:58.68,Main,,0,0,0,,……爷爷罩着我后背。\N{\fs29}...Grandad's got my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.73,0:04:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,别动——我能治。\N{\fs29}Hold still — I can fix this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:17.33,Main,,0,0,0,,圣光，赐我力量。\N{\fs29}Pheta vi acahachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.13,0:04:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,蜡烛不给你！\N{\fs29}You no take candle!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.53,0:04:24.53,Main,,0,0,0,,我爸的锤——\N{\fs29}Dad's hammer—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.13,0:04:28.39,Main,,0,0,0,,我没事。我没事。我没事。\N{\fs29}I'm fine. I'm fine. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.43,0:04:29.43,Main,,0,0,0,,……对不起。\N{\fs29}...Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.53,0:04:30.53,Main,,0,0,0,,一。二。\N{\fs29}One. Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.73,0:04:34.73,Main,,0,0,0,,吃。\N{\fs29}Eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.73,0:04:40.93,Main,,0,0,0,,圣光，赐我力量。\N{\fs29}Pheta vi acahachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.03,0:04:48.29,Main,,0,0,0,,总得有人替你拖住。\N{\fs29}Somebody's got to buy you time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.33,0:04:49.33,Main,,0,0,0,,……我自己能行。\N{\fs29}...I'll manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.03,0:04:51.63,Main,,0,0,0,,……我欠你一回。\N{\fs29}...I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:53.13,Main,,0,0,0,,你们的工钱。\N{\fs29}Your pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.53,0:04:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,葡萄园让戴红面罩的占了——\N带十二块回来。他们头儿有悬赏。\N{\fs29}Red bandanas took the vineyard —\Nbring twelve. Bounty on their boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:58.33,Main,,0,0,0,,十二块？简单！\N{\fs29}Twelve? Easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.73,0:04:59.93,Main,,0,0,0,,先拿回我爸的锤。\N{\fs29}Dad's hammer first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.13,0:05:02.73,Main,,0,0,0,,拿着。暂时用。\N{\fs29}Take this. For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.83,0:05:11.23,Main,,0,0,0,,带着光打。\N{\fs29}Strike with the light on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.63,0:05:12.99,Main,,0,0,0,,……跟溪边那下一样。\N{\fs29}...Like at the stream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.03,0:05:15.03,Main,,0,0,0,,你指哪，光就落哪。\N{\fs29}Light goes where you point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:19.43,Main,,0,0,0,,这个，是送人的。\N{\fs29}This one you give away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.63,0:05:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,让一让——停不下来！\N{\fs29}Coming through — can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:22.83,Main,,0,0,0,,脚下站稳。\N{\fs29}Plant your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.13,0:05:26.53,Main,,0,0,0,,……送给站在你前面的人。\N{\fs29}...To whoever's in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.33,0:05:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,一人六十五！我还从没拿过这么多钱。\N{\fs29}Sixty-five each! Never held this much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,卫兵都穿链甲。\N{\fs29}Guards wear mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.73,0:05:39.73,Main,,0,0,0,,你看着像个卫兵。\N{\fs29}You look like a guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:45.93,Main,,0,0,0,,……我家在闪金镇。他们以为我进了卫兵队。\N{\fs29}...My folks are in Goldshire.\NThey think I made the Guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.53,0:05:49.13,Main,,0,0,0,,听见没？这是链甲。\N{\fs29}Hear that? That's mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.73,0:05:54.73,Main,,0,0,0,,哈！连个印子都没咬出来！\N{\fs29}Ha! Didn't even scratch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.53,Main,,0,0,0,,一个一个来！来啊！\N{\fs29}One at a time! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.63,0:06:12.63,Main,,0,0,0,,我的！我的！\N{\fs29}Mine! Mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:20.13,Main,,0,0,0,,它就是想要点光。\N{\fs29}It just wanted a light.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.13,0:06:27.13,Main,,0,0,0,,别。\N{\fs29}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.33,0:06:28.53,Main,,0,0,0,,正好是我的尺码。\N{\fs29}They're my size.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.13,0:06:32.33,Main,,0,0,0,,十二块面罩。简单。\N{\fs29}Twelve bandanas. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.13,0:06:34.13,Main,,0,0,0,,十二个人。\N{\fs29}Twelve people.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.73,0:06:35.93,Main,,0,0,0,,……没那么简单了。\N{\fs29}...Not so easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.13,0:06:43.33,Main,,0,0,0,,你们是修道院的？那几垄——\N被他们占了，全占了。\N{\fs29}You from the abbey? Those rows there —\Nthey've taken them. All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.13,0:06:50.13,Main,,0,0,0,,只剩三天了。过了，就烂在藤上。\N{\fs29}Three more days. After that, they rot on the vine.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:52.13,Main,,0,0,0,,交给我们！\N{\fs29}Leave it to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.13,0:06:55.73,Main,,0,0,0,,看见没？我停得住！\N{\fs29}See? I can stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.13,0:07:16.13,Main,,0,0,0,,十二块！\N{\fs29}Twelve!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.53,0:07:17.53,Main,,0,0,0,,十一块。\N{\fs29}Eleven.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.73,0:07:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,……十二块。\N{\fs29}...Twelve.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:24.03,Main,,0,0,0,,孩子，叫什么？写进清单里。\N{\fs29}Your name, love? For the manifest.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.73,0:07:25.53,Main,,0,0,0,,亚伦。\N{\fs29}Aaron.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.13,0:07:31.53,Main,,0,0,0,,还有杜克！D-U-K-E。\N{\fs29}And Duke! D-U-K-E.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:37.59,Main,,0,0,0,,把这个交给尼尔斯修士。……谢谢。\N{\fs29}Give this to Brother Neals. ...Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.63,0:07:42.03,Main,,0,0,0,,他们头儿——山坡上那间小屋，成天坐在那儿。\N{\fs29}Their boss — that shack up the hill.\NSits there all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.73,0:07:50.33,Main,,0,0,0,,修道院都派小孩来了。\N{\fs29}Abbey's sending kids now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.43,0:07:54.03,Main,,0,0,0,,……回家吧。告诉派你们来的人，\N他们还欠着我们的。\N{\fs29}...Go home. Tell whoever sent you we're still owed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:54.69,Main,,0,0,0,,欠什么——\N{\fs29}Owed wh—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.73,0:07:56.39,Main,,0,0,0,,我是杜克！打不烂的杜——\N{\fs29}I'm Duke! Duke the Unbrea—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.43,0:07:57.13,Main,,0,0,0,,……行吧。\N{\fs29}...Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.13,0:08:18.73,Main,,0,0,0,,杜克。替我拖住。\N{\fs29}Duke. Buy me time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.13,0:08:20.73,Main,,0,0,0,,好！你慢慢来！\N{\fs29}Yeah! Take your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.13,0:08:25.33,Main,,0,0,0,,圣光，赐我力量。\N{\fs29}Pheta vi acahachi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.63,0:08:53.63,Main,,0,0,0,,……工钱。\N{\fs29}...Wages.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:56.63,Main,,0,0,0,,一。二。\N{\fs29}One. Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.63,0:08:57.63,Main,,0,0,0,,……还是两个。\N{\fs29}...Still two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.13,0:09:04.13,Main,,0,0,0,,「我的葡萄保住了！亚伦，这份清单的持有人，\N闯进了我那片满是暴徒的葡萄园。」\N{\fs29}'My grapes are saved! Aaron, the bearer of this\Nmanifest, braved my thug-infested vineyard.'
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.13,0:09:09.59,Main,,0,0,0,,……矿里也清净了。\N{\fs29}...and the mine's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.63,0:09:12.39,Main,,0,0,0,,还说「不是今天」呢。……好。……锤子。盾牌。\N{\fs29}So much for 'not today.' ...Good. Hammer. Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.43,0:09:13.03,Main,,0,0,0,,……杜克。\N{\fs29}...Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.13,0:09:14.59,Main,,0,0,0,,闪金镇缺人手。\N{\fs29}Goldshire's short of hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.63,0:09:20.09,Main,,0,0,0,,去找治安官杜汉报到。\N闪金镇沿南边的大道走，过了关卡就是。\N{\fs29}Report to Marshal Dughan. Goldshire lies along\Nthe southern road, past the border gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.13,0:09:23.33,Main,,0,0,0,,能教你的就这些了。……暂时。\N{\fs29}That's all I can teach you. For now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:27.33,Main,,0,0,0,,他让我转告你——还欠着他们的。\N{\fs29}He said to tell you — they're still owed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.13,0:09:30.13,Main,,0,0,0,,我留着自己的。谢谢。\N{\fs29}I'll keep mine. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.33,0:09:31.33,Main,,0,0,0,,我也是。\N{\fs29}Same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.63,0:09:34.23,Main,,0,0,0,,后面够不着。\N{\fs29}Can't reach the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.13,0:09:37.53,Main,,0,0,0,,别动。我替你拖住。\N{\fs29}Hold still. I'll buy you time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.13,0:09:45.13,Main,,0,0,0,,挺合身。\N{\fs29}Suits you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.13,0:09:53.73,Main,,0,0,0,,闪金镇。你要回家了。\N{\fs29}Goldshire. You're going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:56.13,Main,,0,0,0,,……嗯。家。\N{\fs29}...Yeah. Home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.13,0:10:07.93,Main,,0,0,0,,我想记住回来的路。\N{\fs29}I want to remember the way back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:12.13,Main,,0,0,0,,一。二。\N{\fs29}One. Two.
